## Chemin SDK Android
sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/Sdk

## Clé Google Maps (Maps SDK + Maps Static API)
## Console : https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
## Activer : Maps SDK for Android + Maps Static API
MAPS_API_KEY=

## URL de l'API Dispo (trailing slash recommandé pour Retrofit)
## Émulateur Android : http://10.0.2.2:8000/
## Appareil USB + adb reverse : http://127.0.0.1:8000/
## Waydroid / LAN : http://IP_DE_TA_MACHINE:8000/
dispo.api.base.url=http://10.0.2.2:8000/
